{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-p038a","title":"曹操初探黄巾营遇挫后振军","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-p038a-account","label":"《魏书》","text":"《魏书》记曹操察看战场误近敌营，损失数百人，后亲巡将士、明赏罚以振军心。","evidence":["wudi-e-p038a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"遇挫振军","evidence":["wudi-e-p038a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"兖州讨黄巾时","year":192,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-p038a-q","wudi-q-o019","wudi-q-b-3863a19b555811d1f415"],"chronology":"wudi-y192","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o019","basis":"兖州讨黄巾时","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,185,"P038a"],"order":87}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-p038a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-6a2c4536e5562bb56e19","layer":"pei","quote":"太祖将步骑千余人，行视战地。猝抵贼营，战不利，死者数百人。引还，贼寻前进。黄巾为贼久，数乘胜，兵皆精悍。太祖旧兵少，新兵不习练，举军皆惧。太祖被甲婴胄，亲巡将士，明劝赏罚；众乃复奋，承间讨击，贼稍折退。","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":184,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-05f4361f482fa19bf760","start":10,"end":111,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-3863a19b555811d1f415","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-3863a19b555811d1f415","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗三年：初平三年（公元 192）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":152,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2063caf2b642ce9ff2bc","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o019","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-43620706e925cc9a268c","layer":"original","quote":"三年春〖1〗，太祖军顿丘，毒等攻东武阳。太祖乃引兵西入山，攻毒等本屯〖2〗。﹝一﹞毒闻之，弃武阳还〖3〗。太祖要击眭固〖4〗，又击匈奴于夫罗于内黄〖5〗，皆大破之。﹝二﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":150,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":85,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
